==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Jigglypuff|87}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion; both cards have the Rollout attack.
*{{m|Rollout}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Jigglypuff}} can learn.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Jigglypuff}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sun}}.

